      <title>Spring Data Redis 连接池：Lettuce 的坑与配置调优</title>
      <link>https://forminio.github.io/posts/spring-data-redis-lettuce-connection/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Feb 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate>
